","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"choice_prompt:13:1810654010":{"key":"choice_prompt:13:1810654010","kind":"choice_prompt","source_node_id":"13","source_node_type":"__DT.MultiChooseNode","statementID":"1810654010","action_index":"","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"<style=highlight>每个地区分部都有一间他的专属办公室</style>，咱们这里也有。不过他不怎么来诺珐斯，也算是一件好事吧，呵呵。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:14:1810654011:0":{"key":"say:14:1810654011:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"14","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1810654011","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"<style=highlight>在地下</style...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:15:1810654012:0":{"key":"say:15:1810654012:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"15","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1810654012","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"除“傲慢”大人以外，只有领主阁下能出入那间办公室。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:17:1810654013:1":{"key":"say:17:1810654013:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"17","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1810654013","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"你故作了然地点了点头，在心里默默盘算着<style=h...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:18:1810654014:1":{"key":"say:18:1810654014:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"18","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1810654014","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"爱德华离开后，你若无其事地扫视了一圈——周围的黑金员工...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:19:1810654015:1":{"key":"say:19:1810654015:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"19","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1810654015","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"真是一个绝妙的<style=highlight>窃取情...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"document:20:613:0":{"key":"document:20:613:0","kind":"document","source_node_id":"20","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"诺珐斯分部选址会议纪要\n参会者：“傲慢”、“懒惰”\n记录者：魔法会议记录器\n“懒惰”向“傲慢”询问有关诺珐斯分部选址的建议，提及先前曾向其提供三个备选地点：称骨广场东侧、海歌剧院北侧、厄冥岩涯遗迹地下。\n“傲慢”拒绝了“懒惰”的提议，坚持将选址定为<style=\"highlight\">商业街北侧，隐秘封印阵所在之处</style>。这一想法遭到了“懒惰”的拒绝，但其情绪反应程度并不强烈。\n随后双方展开争论。以下为“懒惰”的部分发言：\n“建于封印之上？若是<style=\"highlight\">被封印的那位</style>意外逃脱，商会大楼岂不是会轰然倒塌？”\n“并非余要阻拦你，只是余作为诺珐斯领主，不得不考虑本地居民们的感受。万一当真发生意外，黑金商会大可直接撤离，可余还要耗费时间心力去重建诺珐斯……那岂不是太劳神了。”\n“如此强硬……这可不像你。你又在盘算什么计谋？”\n“你谋算之事极有可能危害诺珐斯，余作为领主难道不能过问一二？”\n“哼……随你。若是未来某日封印阵引发灾祸，也不要妄想归咎于余。此外，余需要一份保障诺珐斯安全和可能的灾后重建的协议，以防万一。”\n“你当然可以拒绝，那么余将以‘黑金商会之懒惰’与‘诺珐斯领主’这两个名义自行签署。”\n由于权限设置，无法记录“傲慢”的具体发言。\n最终，与会双方达成一致：诺珐斯分部选址为<style=\"highlight\">商业街最北侧</style>，建造时将在原有礁石基础上提高地势，将<style=\"highlight\">隐秘魔法阵藏于地下深处</style>。","textdes_id":